    "body": "The Hive Mind side is implemented in #2802: the delayed CPU penalty is on by default for `--isolation docker`, and `--container-cpu-penalty-*` / `TELEGRAM_CONTAINER_CPU_PENALTY_*` configure it.\n\nstart-command has no such feature yet, so the design is reported as https://github.com/link-foundation/start/issues/189. As this issue asks, further work on the PR is paused until start-command delivers it. The Hive Mind implementation does not depend on it.",
